content:
Here are the domain objects:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Couple",
      "description": "People getting married and making event decisions"
    },
    {
      "name": "Wedding Vision Brief",
      "description": "Document outlining the couple’s style and budget",
      "attributes": [
        "Theme",
        "Budget"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Theme",
      "description": "Chosen visual or stylistic direction"
    },
    {
      "name": "Budget",
      "description": "Expected spending range for the wedding"
    },
    {
      "name": "Event Schedule",
      "description": "Timeline of key moments on the wedding day",
      "attributes": [
        "Key Moment"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Key Moment",
      "description": "Special planned part of the wedding"
    },
    {
      "name": "Wedding Planner",
      "description": "Person coordinating wedding preparations"
    },
    {
      "name": "Vendor Shortlist",
      "description": "List of suggested providers for the couple",
      "attributes": [
        "Venue Manager",
        "Florist",
        "Catering Manager"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Vendor Booking",
      "description": "Confirmed reservation with a selected vendor"
    },
    {
      "name": "Venue Manager",
      "description": "Person responsible for the wedding location"
    },
    {
      "name": "Venue Confirmation",
      "description": "Response confirming the venue is available"
    },
    {
      "name": "Florist",
      "description": "Vendor creating floral work for the wedding"
    },
    {
      "name": "Floral Arrangement",
      "description": "Decorative flower pieces for the event"
    },
    {
      "name": "Bouquet Delivery",
      "description": "Transport of bouquets and flowers to the venue"
    },
    {
      "name": "Catering Manager",
      "description": "Person managing food service for the event"
    },
    {
      "name": "Menu Order",
      "description": "Final list of dishes and quantities"
    },
    {
      "name": "Meal Service",
      "description": "Execution of serving food during the event"
    }
  ]
}
```

Help me find the associations.  

#### Task:
- Draw connections between objects that have an association. 
- Name each object and add a description that captures the meaning of the association.
- Return the associations in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "...",
      "to": "...",
      "description": "..."
    }
  ]
}
```

